tgs:Human.DennisMeadows a thinkr:Human,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:prefLabel "Dennis Meadows"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Dennis Meadows (human)"@en ;
    owl:sameAs <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dennis_Meadows> ;
    rdfs:comment "Emeritus Professor of Systems Management, MIT; former director, Institute for Policy and Social Science Research, University of New Hampshire. Led the 17-person research team that produced the real 1972 Limits to Growth study for the Club of Rome, using the World3 systems-dynamics model to simulate 13 real distinct scenarios (not a single prediction) for the interaction of population, industrial output, and finite planetary resources through 2100. Co-author of Beyond the Limits. Recipient of four honorary doctorates for contributions to environmental education."@en ;
    .

