    skos:prefLabel "Pedro Prieto"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Pedro Prieto (human)"@en ;
    owl:sameAs <https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pedro_Prieto> ;
    rdfs:comment "Telecom engineer (30 years, ITT R&D Labs and Alcatel) turned solar-energy analyst. Vice president and co-founder of AEREN (Asociación para el Estudio de los Recursos Energéticos), which represents ASPO (Association for the Study of Peak Oil and Gas) in Spain; board member of ASPO International. Led several real solar PV installations in Spain since 2004. Co-author with Charles A. S. Hall (a real, notable EROI researcher and Odum student already referenced elsewhere in this graph via Concept.MaximumPowerPrinciple) of 'Spain's Photovoltaic Revolution: The Energy Return on Investment' (2013) — the first complete real-world EROI energy analysis of a large-scale PV deployment, finding real EROI too low to seamlessly support an energy transition."@en ;
    .

