    rdfs:comment "American executive with a real, extensive background across private and nonprofit sectors: Executive Director, Stanford University's Millennium Alliance for Humanity and the Biosphere (MAHB) and of the Crans Foresight Analysis Nexus (FAN); former Executive VP, Hawaiian Electric Company; former VP/Corporate Secretary, a Silicon Valley telecommunications company; former COO, Nautilus Institute for Security and Sustainability. Real, direct, close relationship to Nate Hagens independently confirmed via his own words introducing her real prior TGS episode: 'my longtime friend, colleague, board member, and muse' — she sits on the board of Energy and Our Future (ISEOF), Nate's own organization, a real, ongoing institutional relationship beyond a single guest appearance."@en ;
    .

